sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ROS as ROS2 Runtime
    participant DC as DataCollector
    participant TP as TransformerPipeline
    participant ED1 as Dispatcher[DataRecord]
    participant EXP as Exporter Layer
    participant CE as ConverterExporter
    participant CV as DataConverter
    participant ED2 as Dispatcher[Any] (DSL)
    participant VS as VerdictService

    Note over ROS,DC: Observation stage
    ROS-->>DC: raw message 
    DC->>DC: wrap as DataRecord
    DC->>TP: process(record)
    TP-->>DC: filtered DataRecord (or None = drop)

    Note over DC,EXP: Transport stage
    DC->>ED1: export(record)
    ED1->>EXP: export(record)
    ED1->>CE: export(record)
    CE->>CV: convert(record)
    CV-->>CE: dsl_record (or None = drop)

    Note over CE,VS: Evaluation stage
    CE->>ED2: export(dsl_record)
    ED2->>VS: export(dsl_record)
    VS->>VS: evaluate(dsl_record)
    VS-->>VS: emit Verdict via exporter (or stay silent)
